# Before: HaveTupleStmt stopped at the statement-IR boundary.
# Now: one representative indexed aggregate consumes both dimension checks and
# exports is-tuple, dimension, and coordinate facts in their source roles.
have tuple q for i1 <= 2, q[i1] = 0
q = q
